JRC2018U LOW-POLY BRAIN ATLAS SURFACE

The file JRC2018U.ply is redistributed from:
https://github.com/navis-org/navis-flybrains

The repository's GPL-3.0 license is included as NAVIS_FLYBRAINS_LICENSE.txt.
The mesh represents the JRC2018U adult Drosophila template brain. Virtual Fly
Brain documents the atlas and its regions at:
https://www.virtualflybrain.org/docs/data/templates/

This project adds the browser rendering and the activity overlay. The colored
activity points are schematic labels for the educational replay and are not
measured neuron firing coordinates.
